              "content": "Structured listing search using normalized filters (option A) or a pre-built Zillow searchQueryState URL (option B). A `bbox` or `searchUrls` is REQUIRED — a free-text location alone is rejected with 400 invalid_filters and never hits upstream. Sync when maxItems ≤ 50, async (202/job) otherwise. Billed at 1 credit per result returned; failed calls are free.",
